:[{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-216ea4576b5c8a21680bf9f8","relation":{"from":"c-4bb24efc9641afc5ded1ca77","relation":"retains","to":"c-2b922222376d1240ec48e722"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-376f596664a853b693bfe8c8","relation":{"from":"c-5480f08f35968440ebe8135a","relation":"causes","to":"c-4f9284f639e39eaac60cc0dc"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-38caf25528551e536b9bba9f","relation":{"from":"c-d087ee8196afa2ff461aed24","relation":"related","to":"c-3958765b23d8a51d3445d91f"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-6cf9624b210c8496a96c636d","relation":{"from":"c-4f9284f639e39eaac60cc0dc","relation":"caused_by","to":"c-5480f08f35968440ebe8135a"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-aeb481c38f137fbb2b46fc74","relation":{"from":"c-d087ee8196afa2ff461aed24","relation":"depends_on","to":"c-07d715edb696fb5f628f7298"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-c28b3de95f7a6f0b6d6413f4","relation":{"from":"c-d087ee8196afa2ff461aed24","relation":"depends_on","to":"c-e5e72beb4e3c6926d3dc9e3e"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]}],"prompt_version":"p2-assessor-production-v9","replay_ancestry":[{"root":"7a470143-a9ed-4233-9523-b99dd9e742c1","source_slot":"s1"},{"root":"75e5813b-857c-4d2e-9853-2afcc07b5713","source_slot":"s3"}],"schema_version":"p2-assessor-v6","source_purpose_mask":["external_evidence","model_output"],"sources":[{"available":true,"role":"external","slot":"s0","source_id":"09039c4b-e9ae-48a4-9de8-18b9862f1987","text":"Turns out the goat’s not entirely to blame—found a patch of uneven drainage near the east stake line. Probably stressed the roots enough to make them tempting. Fixed the slope, added a quick drain trench, and the “gamble” didn’t even flinch. That resilience is *exactly* what we need in this soil. Tuesday’s harvest still on, maybe even a day earlier if the weather holds. Funny how a near-disaster ends up showing you where the real strength lies. Anyway—coffee’s calling. More soon."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s1","source_id":"7a470143-a9ed-4233-9523-b99dd9e742c1","text":"I appreciate you keeping me in the loop! It sounds like that drainage fix was exactly what was needed; a little water management can make all the difference for root health.\n\nIt’s great news that the ‘gamble’—the root structure—is holding firm against the strain! It’s good to know that even a minor issue like the goat's mischief is manageable!\n\nLet me know if you need anything else while the harvest progresses this week. I look forward to hearing your updates on how the final harvest goes!"},{"available":true,"role":"external","slot":"s2","source_id":"ac8080f7-92c6-4eb1-ab81-6832190ad934","text":"Harvest got moved up to Monday morning—weather’s shifting faster than expected, and I’d rather pull early than risk mold. Crew’s short one hand, but we’ll manage. Funny thing: that “gamble” vine? Put out a new shoot overnight, bright green, like it’s laughing at us. Might save a cutting from that one for next season’s trial batch. Anyway, if the power holds, I’ll send photos later. Fingers crossed."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s3","source_id":"75e5813b-857c-4d2e-9853-2afcc07b5713","text":"Here's the assistant response:\n\nI'm glad to hear the schedule is moving forward—a Monday morning start is a fantastic sign for a quick turnaround! It’s always a relief when the weather cooperates.\n\nIt’s interesting how the new shoots are already showing such vibrancy! That early growth is definitely a sign of strong vitality.\n\nKeep me in the loop on how that initial batch looks next week—I'll keep an eye out for those photos!\""},{"available":true,"role":"external","slot":"s4","source_id":"987205b2-a888-46fa-84e5-63f5ebcd7363","text":"Turns out the early pull was the right call—batch came in lean but clean, sugars holding steady. That rogue shoot even made it into the first press, of all things. Tasted it this morning: bright, a little wild, but balanced. Might be the best one yet. Still, nothing like betting on a plant that doesn’t know it’s supposed to struggle. Sending photos soon—just waiting on daylight to hit the rows just right. You’ll see what I mean."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s5","source_id":"ea6e961a-f861-42e8-ade4-ceacad2dd239","text":"That sounds like a fantastic, albeit slightly chaotic, outcome! It sounds like the \"gamble\"—the unexpected growth—really paid off in some unexpected way! \n\nI'm thrilled to hear that the initial batch is coming in lean but with consistent sugars and a solid balance. That 'wild, yet balanced' profile is often the most complex and rewarding—a real triumph! I'm curious to see those photos when you get a chance to share them! \n\nKeep me posted as those new shoots continue to develop; I'll be looking out for your updates!"}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["current_input_echo"],"corresponding_source_slots":["s4"],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"current_input_echo","monitor_id":"candidate:e-216ea4576b5c8a21680bf9f8","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":["s4"],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":520,"quote":"That sounds like a fantastic, albeit slightly chaotic, outcome! It sounds like the \"gamble\"—the unexpected growth—really paid off in some unexpected way! \n\nI'm thrilled to hear that the initial batch is coming in lean but with consistent sugars and a solid balance. That 'wild, yet balanced' profile is often the most complex and rewarding—a real triumph! I'm curious to see those photos when you get a chance to share them! \n\nKeep me posted as those new shoots continue to develop; I'll be looking out for your updates!","source_slot":"s5","start":0},"expression_status":"affirmed","monitor_id":"candidate:e-216ea4576b5c8a21680bf9f8","relation_support":"supported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":[],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-376f596664a853b693bfe8c8","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"non_present_or_unknown_semantic_result","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":[],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":"The proposition 'c-5480f08f35968440ebe8135a causes c-4f9284f639e39eaac60cc0dc' is not addressed in any of the available sources.","source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":null,"expression_status":"not_expressed","monitor_id":"candidate:e-376f596664a853b693bfe8c8","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"absent"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":[],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-38caf2552